## User preferences

- When the user said "直接資料本文で確認済み" and "既存カードと非重複" -> verify card-specific mechanism correspondence in the source body and classify `exact`/`partial`/`reject`; a reachable URL is not evidence. [Task 1]
- When the user said "危険装置の施工手順は作らず、模型または専門業者前提の能力参照だけ" -> record capabilities, conditions, safety boundaries, and specialist requirements; do not supply construction steps or safety guarantees. [Task 1]
- When the user asked to collect "演出のアイデアみたいなところをできる限り" and retain "予算感やできる範囲、システム内部" -> store examples, mechanism, feasible range, budget uncertainty, safety, and rights as separate card fields. At 1,000 cards, stop collection and analyze sources, system families, digital dependence, budget, `exact`/`partial`/`reject`, risks/rights, and duplicate/evidence-thin candidates; Stage Sketch implementation is a separately approved task. [Task 1]

## Reusable knowledge

- Keep `show-reference/data/reference_index.json` canonical and untouched. Add drafts under `show-reference/data/drafts/` through a deterministic generator, then regenerate `shosai-app/stage-apparatus-data.js`. [Task 1]
- Waves 75–82 added source-backed cards from individual university, museum, official institution, and manufacturer bodies, reaching local `stage-apparatus-data.js` bundle count 821. `show-reference/data/reference_index.json` remained canonical/read-only. [Task 1]
- Verify with `python3 shosai-app/build_stage_apparatus.py --check`, `node --check shosai-app/app.js`, `node --test shosai-app/tests/*.test.mjs`, `python3 show-reference/scripts/build_stage_apparatus_wave_reports.py --check`, `git -C shosai-app diff --check`, canonical/bundle hashes, and ledger validation. Budget/safety/right language is planning reference, not construction advice, guarantee, quote, or rights clearance. [Task 1]

## Failures and how to do differently

- After the 1,000-card continuation began, uncommitted `shosai-app` work increased/changed from the recorded protected baseline. Stop all Wave 83+ DB writes and analysis rather than risk overwriting user work. Resume only after the user explicitly approves the current worktree as a new protected baseline or related work is reconciled. `db-1-000` was deleted; do not claim the target or analysis completed. [Task 1]
- DB generation/report/ledger/hash checks passed, but the full Node suite had two PWA/sample failures caused by user Stage Sketch changes expecting old asset versions. Report the partial validation accurately; do not call the suite fully green. [Task 1]

